nextended — COPYRIGHT NOTICE AND LIMITED PERSONAL USE TERMS

Project: nextended
Description: A Manifest V3 browser extension that unifies three Nexus Mods
userscripts (collections bulk download, no-wait single downloads, archived-file
buttons) into one install.
Copyright (c) 2026 nextended contributors. All rights reserved.

Source: https://github.com/Zendevve/nextended

